{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想在通勤途中或等待的時間敲出腦海裡的節奏，iAmDrums 把一整組爵士鼓放進 iPhone 與 iPad。它沒有廣告、沒有訂閱，亦無需註冊帳號，一次付費即可使用全部 20 套鼓組與所有功能。原價 US $3.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>敲擊位置決定音色</h2>\n<p>App 內建 20 套鼓組，全部包含在一次付費之內，涵蓋搖滾、龐克至電子與管絃風格。每套鼓組會按敲擊位置變化：越近鼓心聲音越響，越近邊緣越輕；敲小鼓邊框可做出 rim shot，敲 ride 中央則響出 bell 音色。內置 Loop Maker 可先編排節奏並存入 KickStart 音色庫，之後配上任何一套鼓組重播。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-11-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-12-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-13-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-14-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-15-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：iAmDrums</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T17:57:59.028121+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}